    <node id="&quot;ABINGDON-AVON HIGH SCHOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Abingdon-Avon High School (AAHS) is a public four-year high school located in Abingdon, Illinois, offering a comprehensive academic and vocational program."</data>
